    <tags>pyrevit revit python automation bim</tags>
    <summary>Rapid application development environment for Autodesk Revit, installed for all users</summary>
    <description>pyRevit is a rapid application development (RAD) environment for Autodesk Revit.
It lets you write Revit automation tools in Python, C# or VB.NET and ships a large set of ready-made tools.

This package runs the pyRevit admin installer silently. It installs pyRevit for all users, attaches it to every
installed Revit version and adds the pyRevit command line tool to the machine PATH.
Uninstalling the package runs the installer's own uninstaller.

The package includes the pyRevit CLI. Do not install the pyrevit-cli package next to it.
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/pyrevitlabs/pyRevit/releases/tag/v7.0.0.26278%2B2233/</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="dotnetfx" version="4.8.0.20190930" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
